          impact: "Gable end walls only support the roof triangle, requiring much smaller headers. If you use gable-end tables for an eave wall carrying roof trusses, the beam will be undersized by 50% and will crack.",
          prevention: "Look up at your roof trusses. If the truss ends sit on the garage door wall, it is an exterior bearing wall."
        },
